  "content": {
    "original": [
      "大江东去",
      "浪淘尽",
      "千古风流人物",
      "故垒西边",
      "人道是",
      "三国周郎赤壁",
      "乱石穿空",
      "惊涛拍岸",
      "卷起千堆雪",
      "江山如画",
      "一时多少豪杰",
      "遥想公瑾当年",
      "小乔初嫁了",
      "雄姿英发",
      "羽扇纶巾",
      "谈笑间",
      "樯橹灰飞烟灭",
      "故国神游",
      "多情应笑我",
      "早生华发",
      "人生如梦",
      "一尊还酹江月"
    ],
    "translation": [
      "the great river flows east",
      "its waves wash away",
      "the heroes of a thousand years",
      "west of the old fort",
      "people say",
      "is the red cliff of young general zhou of the three kingdoms",
      "jagged rocks pierce the sky",
      "startling waves beat the shore",
      "rolling up a thousand heaps of snow",
      "rivers and mountains like a painting",
      "how many heroes were there in that one age",
      "i think back to gongjin in those years",
      "xiao qiao had just married him",
      "his bearing heroic, his spirit bright",
      "a feather fan and a silk headband",
      "between talk and laughter",
      "the enemy's masts and oars turned to flying ash and smoke",
      "my spirit wanders in that old land",
      "being so sentimental, i should laugh at myself",
      "my hair has turned white too early",
      "life is like a dream",
      "i pour a cup of wine to the river moon"
    ],
